WEBVTT

00:00:29.913 --> 00:00:31.397
Last looks.

00:00:34.479 --> 00:00:35.774
Man 2: We're at roll time.

00:00:35.798 --> 00:00:37.756
Man 3: Rolling!
Man 2: Roll cameras.

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:39.843
Man 3: A speed, B speed, C speed.

00:00:39.867 --> 00:00:42.336
Man 1: Marker. And ... action.

00:00:43.366 --> 00:00:45.952
MM: I started making movies 15 years ago,

00:00:45.976 --> 00:00:48.161
during my internal medicine residency,

00:00:48.185 --> 00:00:49.795
as one does.

00:00:49.819 --> 00:00:53.187
I was doing HIV disparities research
amongst Black women,

00:00:53.211 --> 00:00:55.356
and that work turned into a documentary,

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:57.895
and I've been making movies ever since.

00:00:57.919 --> 00:01:00.645
I like to think of the movies
and shows I create